MODULE: PublishSuppressedForever
TARGET: UsageConverges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: hysteresis suppresses every positive local sample permanently
PERTURBS: Publish

--- FIND
    /\ published' = [published EXCEPT ![r] = sample[r]]
    /\ slots' = [slots EXCEPT ![r][r] = Max(@, sample[r])]
--- REPLACE
    /\ published' = published
    /\ slots' = slots
--- END
